      "token_usage": "EXCLUDED FROM FORMAL STUDY-02 METRICS, matching Study-01's S10 rule",
      "unnecessary_change_rubric": "EXCLUDED FROM FORMAL STUDY-02 METRICS; no frozen rubric; no weighted or composite quality score"
